WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,880
I haven’t seen you for a few months and I’m so angry

2
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:07,250
Wen Chen is also a party involved

3
00:00:07,450 --> 00:00:09,090
We decided to get married without even asking him a question.

4
00:00:09,090 --> 00:00:10,290
Are they afraid of him robbing them?

5
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:11,610
Tell him so what

6
00:00:11,810 --> 00:00:13,170
You don’t even have contact information

7
00:00:15,670 --> 00:00:17,630
This is my car. I'm going to find him.

8
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:20,780
There are no classes at the university on weekends. Where can you find them?

9
00:00:21,220 --> 00:00:22,500
Let’s go to school and look for it first.

10
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:28,140
Chief Wen, wait a moment. I'll handle it right away.

11
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:34,240
Why are there still clothes? Corporate culture

12
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,840
Combat uniforms, special materials, warmth

13
00:00:36,840 --> 00:00:37,920
It’s also convenient to fight

14
00:00:38,350 --> 00:00:42,280
Can I apply for a dormitory? I want to live next door to you.

15
00:00:43,930 --> 00:00:46,010
It turns out that’s how he got his two mobile phones.

16
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,600
I also want to visit the training ground
